Homepage: https://github.com/martijndeb/liteadmin
Description: Audit log plugin for LiteAdmin
 Records every write LiteAdmin performs: SQL run from the editor, REST and
 GraphQL writes, and admin actions such as API key changes, API exposure and
 password changes, with the actor, source IP, statement and outcome. Entries
 are hash-chained so edits and deletions can be detected, and can be searched,
 exported as CSV/JSON, verified and pruned from the Plugins panel. The log is
 stored in /var/lib/liteadmin/data/liteadmin-auditlog/. Enabled on install.

