Homepage: https://github.com/martijndeb/liteadmin
Description: GraphQL API plugin for LiteAdmin
 Serves the databases and tables selected in the liteadmin-restapi panel as a
 GraphQL API at /graphql/<database>: list, by-key and count queries, insert,
 update and delete mutations, and relation fields derived from foreign keys.
 Requests are authenticated with liteadmin-apikeys (mutations need a read+write
 key), the schema is published as SDL at /graphql/<database>/schema.graphql, and
 admins get a query console in the Plugins panel. No external dependencies.
 Like the REST API it serves data, so it is NOT enabled automatically on
 install: add "liteadmin-graphql" to the config to enable it.

