Homepage: https://github.com/martijndeb/liteadmin
Description: REST API plugin for LiteAdmin
 Exposes selected LiteAdmin databases and tables as a CRUD REST API at
 /api/<database>/<table>, using the standard GET, POST, PUT, PATCH and DELETE
 verbs. Requests are authenticated with the liteadmin-apikeys plugin, and an
 OpenAPI 3.0 document is generated per database at /api/<database>/openapi.json.
 The plugin is optional and, unlike most LiteAdmin plugins, is NOT enabled
 automatically on install: pick the databases and tables to serve from the
 Plugins panel first, and add "liteadmin-restapi" to the config to enable it.

